https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1011\n\n[Tarrask](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1011) is malware that has been used by [HAFNIUM](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0125) since at least August 2021. [Tarrask](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1011) was designed to evade digital defenses and maintain persistence by generating concealed scheduled tasks.(Citation: Tarrask scheduled task)\n\n## Techniques used\n- T1036.005 Match Legitimate Resource Name or Location\n- T1059.003 Windows Command Shell\n- T1134.001 Token Impersonation/Theft\n- T1036.004 Masquerade Task or Service\n- T1053.005 Scheduled Task\n- T1112 Modify Registry\n- T1564 Hide Artifacts\n", "mitre-attack-software-s1197": "# S1197 GoBear\n\n**ATT&CK ID:** S1197\n**Type:** software\n**Aliases:** n/a\n**Reference:** https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1197\n\n[GoBear](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1197) is a Go-based backdoor that abuses legitimate, stolen certificates for defense evasion purposes. [GoBear](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1197) is exclusively linked to [Kimsuky](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0094) operations.(Citation: S2W Troll Stealer 2024)(Citation: Symantec Troll Stealer 2024)\n\n## Techniques used\n- T1090 Proxy\n- T1036.005 Match Legitimate Resource Name or Location\n- T1553.002 Code Signing\n", "mitre-attack-software-s0155": "# S0155 WINDSHIELD\n\n**ATT&CK ID:** S0155\n**Type:** software\n**Aliases:** n/a\n**Reference:** https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0155\n\n[WINDSHIELD](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0155) is a signature backdoor used by [APT32](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0050). (Citation: FireEye APT32 May 2017)\n\n## Techniques used\n- T1095 Non-Application Layer Protocol\n- T1033 System Owner/User Discovery\n- T1012 Query Registry\n- T1082 System Information Discovery\n- T1070.004 File Deletion\n", "mitre-attack-software-s0502": "# S0502 Drovorub\n\n**ATT&CK ID:** S0502\n**Type:** software\n**Aliases:** n/a\n**Reference:** https://attack.mitre.org/s