rbon Spider August 2021)\n\n## Techniques used\n- T1053.005 Scheduled Task\n- T1059.005 Visual Basic\n- T1059.007 JavaScript\n- T1566.001 Spearphishing Attachment\n- T1105 Ingress Tool Transfer\n- T1204.002 Malicious File\n- T1059.001 PowerShell\n", "mitre-attack-software-s0158": "# S0158 PHOREAL\n\n**ATT&CK ID:** S0158\n**Type:** software\n**Aliases:** n/a\n**Reference:** https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0158\n\n[PHOREAL](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0158) is a signature backdoor used by [APT32](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0050). (Citation: FireEye APT32 May 2017)\n\n## Techniques used\n- T1112 Modify Registry\n- T1059.003 Windows Command Shell\n- T1095 Non-Application Layer Protocol\n", "mitre-attack-software-s0165": "# S0165 OSInfo\n\n**ATT&CK ID:** S0165\n**Type:** software\n**Aliases:** n/a\n**Reference:** https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0165\n\n[OSInfo](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0165) is a custom tool used by [APT3](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G0022) to do internal discovery on a victim's computer and network. (Citation: Symantec Buckeye)\n\n## Techniques used\n- T1087.001 Local Account\n- T1012 Query Registry\n- T1082 System Information Discovery\n- T1049 System Network Connections Discovery\n- T1018 Remote System Discovery\n- T1069.002 Domain Groups\n- T1087.002 Domain Account\n- T1069.001 Local Groups\n- T1135 Network Share Discovery\n- T1016 System Network Configuration Discovery\n", "mitre-attack-software-s0282": "# S0282 MacSpy\n\n**ATT&CK ID:** S0282\n**Type:** software\n**Aliases:** n/a\n**Reference:** https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0282\n\n[MacSpy](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S0282) is a malware-as-a-service offered on the darkweb  (Citation: objsee mac malware 2017).\n\n## Techniques used\n- T1070.004 File Deletion\n- T1090.003 Multi-hop Proxy\n- T1071.001 Web Protocols\n- T1543.001 Launch Agent\n- T1115 Clipboard Data\n- T1564.001 Hidden Files and Directories\n- T1123 Audio Capture\n- T1113 Screen Capture\n- T1