_UNC1549_Nov2025) [TRUSTTRAP](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S9064) was first observed in 2023 and has been affiliated with the cyber espionage threat group [NIMBUS MANTICORE](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G1059).(Citation: Mandiant_UNC1549_Nov2025)\n\n## Techniques used\n- T1056.002 GUI Input Capture\n- T1684.001 Impersonation\n- T1074.001 Local Data Staging\n", "mitre-attack-software-s9059": "# S9059 MiniBike\n\n**ATT&CK ID:** S9059\n**Type:** software\n**Aliases:** n/a\n**Reference:** https://attack.mitre.org/software/S9059\n\n[MiniBike](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S9059) is a custom backdoor written in C++ designed for command execution, data discovery, gathering, and exfiltration.(Citation: Mandiant_UNC1549_Feb2024)  [MiniBike](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S9059) has been known to communicate with the C2 using Azure Cloud Infrastructure. [MiniBike](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S9059) was first observed in 2022.(Citation: Mandiant_UNC1549_Feb2024)  [MiniBike](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S9059) has been affiliated with the cyber espionage threat group [NIMBUS MANTICORE](https://attack.mitre.org/groups/G1059).(Citation: Mandiant_UNC1549_Feb2024)\n\n## Techniques used\n- T1105 Ingress Tool Transfer\n- T1071.001 Web Protocols\n- T1027.015 Compression\n- T1574.001 DLL\n- T1041 Exfiltration Over C2 Channel\n- T1547.001 Registry Run Keys / Startup Folder\n- T1083 File and Directory Discovery\n- T1082 System Information Discovery\n- T1005 Data from Local System\n", "mitre-attack-software-s9061": "# S9061 LIGHTRAIL\n\n**ATT&CK ID:** S9061\n**Type:** software\n**Aliases:** n/a\n**Reference:** https://attack.mitre.org/software/S9061\n\n[LIGHTRAIL](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S9061) is a tunneler malware.(Citation: Mandiant_UNC1549_Feb2024) [LIGHTRAIL](https://attack.mitre.org/software/S9061) has been known to communicate with C2 SOCKS4A Websocket communications.(Citation: Mandiant_UNC1549_Feb2024) [LIGHTRAIL](https://attack.mitre.org/softwa